Subject: [PATCH] Add dropLoot option to Block.breakNaturally


diff --git a/src/main/java/org/bukkit/block/Block.java b/src/main/java/org/bukkit/block/Block.java
index 318bb02fe2921e5c41e7473500d1cf4dacf0c781..cb047a992977448281fb9b5c005fe6628d4cca86 100644
